              <span><strong>Active Restoration vs. Passive Eco-Dives:</strong> Understand the difference. This guide focuses on *active* work: planting corals, collecting data, and removing debris, not just "eco-friendly" fun dives.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-map-marker-alt mr-3 text-gold mt-1 w-5 text-center" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span><strong>Location Defines the Mission:</strong> Learn where to go for specific tasks. Head to Pemuteran or Amed for world-class coral gardening, or Nusa Penida for vital megafauna (Manta Ray) research.</span>
            </div>
